function eventStockForm(s){modal(s?'Adjust event stock':'Add event stock',`<form>${input('name','Flavor / stock unit name',s?.name||'','text','maxlength="160"')}${input('available','Available pieces / units now',s?.remaining||0,'number','required min="0" max="1000000" step="1"')}${input('surcharge','Custom-box surcharge · PHP',amount(s?.surcharge_cents),'number','required min="0" step="0.01"')}${input('reason','Reason',s?'':'Initial event stock','text','required maxlength="1000"')}<p class="muted">This changes only this event’s stock. Sales already recorded stay in history.</p><button class="primary" type="submit">Save stock</button></form>`,async f=>{await api('pos_save_event_stock',{event_id:eventId,id:s?.id||uid(),revision:s?.revision||0,name:f.get('name'),surcharge_cents:cents(f.get('surcharge')),available:Number(f.get('available')),expected_available:s?.remaining||0,reason:f.get('reason')});await load();dialog.close();render();});}
